<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1 Corinth</book>
  <para style="h">1 Corinth</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Corinth</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Corinth</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Corinth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien’ deina tawh Khris’ sawltahpi dinga kihlan Paul le i sanggam pa Sosthenes in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Corinth khuo Khris Jesu sungah a kisiensuosa mite a kipan misiengtho dinga kihlante le Topa Jesu Khris’ min a lo muncin tenga om mi zosiete tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />i Pa Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris tung pan hepina le lungmuonna na tung vuah om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khris Jesu sungah note adinga ang kipiesa Pasien’ hepina ziehin Pasien tungah nuom thu ka tut ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note pen ama sungah thugenna le theina namcin tawh na bukim zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note lahah Khris’ thu teci panna a kikipsah zo ma bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />i Topa Jesu Khris ang kilah ding ngahin na om sungun zong Hlagau letsong tasap na nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I Topa Jesu Khris’ ni ciengin kaw baang lo-a na op thei nadingun ama in a tawp tanpha-in ang thakhausah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A Tapa i Topa Jesu Khris tawh kipawlna sungah note ang hlan pa Pasien muonhuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, na unpi-un kithutuoh-in note lahah pawlkhenna a op lo nading le, lungsim le tupna kibang khat sungah na kigawm thei nadingun Topa Jesu Khris’ min tawh kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ka sanggamte aw, note lahah kihauna om hi, ci thu Chloe’ mite pawlkhat in ei zasah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ci nopna-ah note khat ciet in, ‘Kei Paul’ pawl, kei Apollos’ pawl, kei Chephas’ pawl, kei Khris’ pawl ka hi hi,” na ci deidoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khris a kikhen amah? Note adingin singlamte tungah Paul a kikhailia amah? Ahi sihle Paul’ min suongin na ki-baptize uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Crispus le Gaius simlo koima khat beh kang bapitize khah lo ziehin Pasien kungah nuom thu ka tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n koima in keima’ min suongin ka ki-baptize hi, ei ci thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Stephanas-te innkuon zong ka baptize hi; tua lo adang ka baptize lam ka thei kha sih hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen Khris in mi baptize dinga ei sawl hi loin lungdamna thu hil dinga ei sawl ahi zaw a, ka thugen siem man zong ahi sih hi. Hi mawh leh Khris’ singlamte vanglietna a hawmsuohsah kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a mangthai mite adingin singlamte’ thu pen motna ahi a, ahi vangin hutdamsa eite adingin Pasien’ vanglietna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen, “A pilte’ pilna ka susie ding a, miteite’ teina ka sumai ding hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipil hei-ah om ahei? Laisiem pa hei-ah om ahei? Tuhun mi thu nielsiem pa hei-ah om ahei? Pasien in leitung pilna pen motna suohsah zo hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Pasien’ pilna sungah leitung mite in a pilna uh tungtawnin Pasien a thei lo tah ziehun, a mothuoi kote’ thuhilna tungtawnin Pasien in a um mite hutdam dingin a khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azieh pen Jew mite in lim ngenin Greek-te in pilna a deigaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hizongle kote in Jew mite adingin kisui khahna suong le Greek-te adingin motna ahi a kikhailia Khris’ thu ka hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hizongle a hlatsa Jew mite le Greek-te adingin Khris pen Pasien’ vanglietna le Pasien’ pilna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Azieh pen mihing’ pilna sangin Pasien’ motna pilzaw a, mihing’ hatna sangin Pasien’ thanemna hatzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, ang kihlat lai-a na dinmun uh ngaisun un; mihing muna panin note a tamzaw mipil hi loin, mi vanglien zong na tam sih vua, pienpi nampi zong tampi na om sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin mipilte a maizumsah dingin leitungah Pasien in mimawte teel a, a kihatsahte muolpho nadingin Pasien in a thanem mite a teel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A omsa nate bangma loin a kiemsuh nadingin Pasien in leitungah a gina lo nate le a kisimmawte a teel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua khu Pasien mai-ah koima a kisiel thei lo nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama pen Khris Jesu sungah na hinna zungpi uh ahi a, Pasien in Khris pen i pilna, i dihna, i sienthona le i kitatkhietna a suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ziehin, “A kisiel poma, Topa sungah kisiel taheh,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, na kung vuah Pasien’ thu thuhpi a phuongzah dingin kang haw lai-in kihisahna kam le pilna kamte ka zang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen note lahah singlamte tunga a kikhailia Jesu Khris simlo bangma thei ka sawm sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kung vuah kang pei lai-in ka tha a nem a, zau-in ka ci nahpi-in a tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kamham le ka thu phuongzahte zong pilna kam tawh ahi sih a, Pasien’ Hlagau le a vanglietna tawh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuami in na upna uh mihing pilna tungah kinga loin Pasien’ vanglietna tungah a kingah zawh nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanle kote in a picingsate lahah pilna thu ka gen uhi, tua pilna pen tu khanghun ahi sihle a maimang kuonkuon ta ding ahi tu khanghun gam-uhte’ pilna ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin kote in leitung pien masang peha eite minthan nadinga Pasien in a na sekholsa Pasien’ pilna, a thusim le a phuolsel thute ka gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam khanghun lai-a gam-uhte khat beh in tami thu a telsiem sih uhi; azieh pen amate in a na telsiem uh hileh minthang Topa a na khailia sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin, “Mit in a mu ngai lo, bil in a zah ngai lo, mihing lungsim in a ngaisut ngai lo, Pasien in ama a it mite adingin a bawlpiehsa thu ahi hi,” ci-a a kigiel bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien in tam thu teng Hlagau tungtawnin ei theisah zo hi; azieh pen Hlagau in na vannuoi sui a, Pasien’ thuthuhte nangawn a kankhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a sunga a om mihing’ hlagau simlo koi mihing in tua mihing tahtah pen thei ahei? Tua ma bangin Pasien’ Hlagau simlo Pasien’ ngaisutna tahtahte koima in thei zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in eite pen leitung hlagau nga i hi sih vua, Pasien in eite tunga ei pieh letsongte i telsiem thei nadingin Pasien tung pana ang pei hlagau nga i hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale kote pen mihing pilna tawh a kihil kammalte zanga thu gen ka hi sih vua, Hlagau’ pilna tawh hlagau mite kungah hlagau lam thute letkhie-in a gen ka hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlagau mi ahi lote adingin Pasien’ Hlagau letsongte pen motna hi lel ahi ziehin amate in a sang zo sih uhi, bangzieh ahei cile tuate pen hla lam thu beh tawh kikhentel thei ahi ziehin amate in a telthei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hlagau mite in na vannuoi a khentel thei vua, amate in koima’ sittelna a thuoh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Azieh pen Topa a hil thei nadingin koi in ama’ lungsim thei ahei?” kici hi. Ahi vangin eite in Khris’ lungsim i nei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin sanggamte aw, hlagau mite tunga thugen bangin kang gen thei sih a, tahsa mite tunga thugen bang le Khris upna sungah nausente tunga thugen bangin kang genzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note in antah ne zo nai lo na hi ziehun antah kang pie sih a, nawizu tawh kang va hi. Note in tu nangawnin zong na ne zo nai sih uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile na tahsa tawn lai uhi. Note lahah hazatna le kihauna a op laisie, note pen tahsa tawnin leitung mihing lungsim’ deina banga a gamta na hi sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen mi khat in, “Kei Paul’ pawl ka hi hi,” ci-in, adang khat in, “Kei Apollos’ pawl ka hi hi,” na ci nah valuoi ciengun mihing lel ma hi lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahile Apollos bang hi poma ahei? Paul zong bang hi mawh ahei? Amate tungtawnin note in na up thei nadingun amate sep dinga Topa in a guot ciet nasemte ahi lel bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in ka suon a, Apollos in tui a buoh hi, ahi vangin a khangsah pen Pasien ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n a suon pa hile, tuibuoh pa hile a thupi sih a, a khangsah Pasien a thupi hi beh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A suon pa le tuibuoh pa’ lungtup a kibang hi a, a sepna uh tawh kizui-in thaman a nga tuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kote pen na a semton Pasien’ nasemte ka hi vua, note na hi ule Pasien’ logam, Pasien’ inn na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien in keima tunga ei pieh hepina dung zui-in innlam siem pa khat bangin khuombul khat ka phut zo a, tuaci’n midang khat in tua tungah a lam hi. Tua tunga inn lam poma in bangci lam ding ci pen pilvangtaha a teel ciet ding uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen a kiphutsa Jesu Khris longal khuombul dang koima in phut thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi khatpo in tua khuombul tungah kham, ngun, suong manpha, sing, lopa gaw le butu tawh inn a lam leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuami Ni in a nasepna uh pholah ding ahi ziehin, a lamte’ sepna ciet zong mu thei-in ang om ding hi, azieh pen tua sepnate mei tawh kisit ding a, mite’ nasepna ciet mei in a ze-et ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuombul tunga a lamsate bangma a ci sih leh, a lam pa in thaman a nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua nasepna a kahtum leh a lam pa a sum hi ding hi; a lampa suohta ding a, ahi vangin ama pen mei sung pana a suohta bang dan lelin suohta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note pen Pasien’ biehinnpi na hi vua, na sung vuah Pasien’ Hlagau a ten lam na thei sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi khat in Pasien’ biehinnpi a suhsiet leh Pasien in ama zong susie ding hi. Azieh pen biehinnpi siengtho a, note zong tua biehinnpi na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Noma le noma kisol sih un. Tam khanghun sungah a pila na kingaisut uleh a pil na suo thei nadingun mi maw suoh phot un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen tam leitung pilna pen Pasien adingin motna ahi hi. Azieh pen, “Ama in mipilte amau’ ngian ma-ah a man hi,” ci-in kigiel hi. Tuale khatvei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“ Topa in a pilte’ ngaisutna pen a mawhna ahi lam thei hi,” ci-in kigielkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n koima in mihing makaite kisielpi da heh. Bangzieh ahei cile na vannuoi noma-a’ ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Paul hile, Apollos hile, Chephas hile, leitung hile, tuhun hile, mailam hun hile, a unpi-in noma-a’ ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />note zong Khris-a’ na hi vua, Khris zong Pasien-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kote pen Khris’ nasemte le Pasien’ thusim kemte bangin ei ngaisun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua tham loin thusim kemte pen a muonhuoi ding uh kisam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin note na hi vua, leitung thukhen zum ahi zongin kei tunga thu nei khen uleh tua pen kei adingin thuneu khat hi lel hi. Kei le kei nangawn thu ka kikhen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in ei kimawsah nading bangma khat beh ka thei sih hi, ahi vangin tua ka ci ziehin kei maw peng ka hi pai tuon sih hi. Kei tunga thukhenpa pen Topa ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin khuomiel sungah tu-a sil kiphuoldapte khuovah sung a tut ding le lungsim sunga gelnate a pholah dingin Topa ang pei ding hun masangin thu na khen sih un. Tua hun ciengin Pasien kung panin mikim in phatna a nga ciet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, note phattuom nadingin, “A kigielsa valin gamta sih un,” a ci pen khu ko tungtawnin note in a khietna na sin thei nading ule mi khat kisahtheipi-in adang khat na niel lo nadingun Apollos le kei mama tungah tami thu zosie ka zang zo ta hi. Tuaci’n note in mi khatpo kisahtheipi-in adang khatpo na pum niel sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen koi in na sung vuah kilamdanna khatpo a mu ahei? Na nga lo uh bang nei na hi uh ahei? A nga na hi ule zong bang dinga a nga lo bang dan a kisathei na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note in na dei zosie uh na nei zo ta uhi! A hau zo na hi ta uhi! Ko tawh loin kumpi na suoh zo ta uhi! Note tawh kumpi i suoton thei nadingin kumpi suoh tahpi locin ka nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ko sawltahpite ka hi ule sina thukhenna thuoh dingte bangin Pasien in mi zosie lahah a zaneu penin ei koi zo tawh kibang ka sa hi, bangzieh ahei cile kote pen leitung mite, vantung mite le mihingte adingin guolnopna pawi sunga etnop ka suoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khris ziehin mimaw ka hi ta vua, ahi vangin note pen Khris sungah mipil na hi uhi! Ko ka thanem vua, ahi vangin no na thakhau uhi. No ang kipatawi a, ahi vangin ko ei kisimmaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuni cieng dong gilkiel dangta-in puonsil ding nei loin ka om vua, satna thuohin inn le lo nei loin ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koma’ khut ma tawh gim le tawlin na ka sem uhi. Ei kisimmaw ciengin thupha ka pie uhi; ei kibawlsiet ciengin ka thuoh kenkon uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ei kidaisah ciengin kamhlum tawh ka dawngkia uhi. Kote ka hi ule leitung buathah lom tawh ka kibang vua, tuni dong ciengin sil bangkim’ buathah dopniehte ka bang bep lel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam pen na zum nading vua kang giel ahi sih a, ka it ka tate banga kang thuhilna uh hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note in Khris sungah ang kem mi tul sawm nei phiel nan locin pa tampi na nei sih uhi. A tahtahin lungdamna thu ziehin Khris Jesu sungah na pa uh ka suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin note in kei nei ette dingun kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin keima in muncin tenga om hlattuom pawlpi zosie thu ka hil bangin Khris Jesu sungah ka gamtat ziete ang phawhsah kia dingin na kung vuah Topa sunga ka it mama le a muonhuoi ka tapa Timothy kang sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat in na kung vua ang haw lo dinga ei ngaisut ziehun a kiphasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in lem a sah leh na kung vuah a sawt loin kang haw ding a, tua a kiphasah mite’ kamham beh hi loin amau’ vanglietna ka mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien’ manggam pen kamham tunga kinga hi loin, vanglietna tunga kinga ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na kung vuah ciengduoi tawh kang pei diei mah? Ahi sihle itna le lungnemna tawh kang pei diei? Koi deizaw na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note lahah lawkite lah nangawn a zong a om ngai lo numei-pasal pahtatna a om hi, ci-in ang kigen tahpi hi; azieh pen mi khat in a pa’ zi a kinunpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note kisahthei mawh uteh! Note lah panin tua banga a gamta mipa hemkhie ding na hi ziehun a da a kap ding na hizaw sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen tahsa tawh kang ompi lo vangin hlagau tawh kang ompi veve hi; tuale a omton za ma bangin keima in tua banga a gamta mipa tungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa Jesu Khris’ minin thu ka khen zo ta hi. Na kikhop ton ciengun Topa Jesu’ vanglietna tawh ka hlagau in note ang ompi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa’ ni ang tun ciengin ama’ hlagau in hutdamna a nga thei nadingin Satan’ khut sungah suhsiet dingin tuami tahsa na pie ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na kisahthei mawh pen uh a hoi sih hi. Tol themno khat in annel lompi zelin a pawmsah thei lamtah na thei sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note tol saw lo annel lom tha na hi tahpi bangun na hi suoh nadingun tol lui teng na hemsieng un. Azieh pen biehpiehna dingin eite’ peisan tuuno ahi Khris kigo zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin eite in kheltatna le gitlona tol luite tawh hi loin, lungsim siengthona le thuman thutah ahi tol kisaw lo anlum tawh pawi bawl zaw va vui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Numei-pasal pahtatte tawh na kigop lo nadingun kang laihlah sungah ka giel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua bang ka ci ciengin tami leitunga a pahtatte, a huoihamte le a gutate, ahi sihle milim a biete ka ci nopna hi lo hi. Tua bang hi mawh leh leitung pana na pusuo uh ngai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in sanggam min puo sam napi a pahtat le a huoiham, milim a bie, mi a gensie, zukham, ahi sihle a guta khatpo tawh na kigop sih un, ci-a na kung vua lai ang giel ka hizaw hi. Tua bang mite tawh an nangawn na ne ton sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen pulam mite tunga thu khen ding pen kei tawh bang kisai ahei? A sunga om mite tunga thukhen ding na hi sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pulam mite tungah Pasien in thu a khen ding hi. “Note lah panin tam migilo pa na notmang un,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note lahah khatpo in midang khat tawh a kisiet ciengin misiengthote kungah tutzaw lo a, bang dinga thukhen zum midih lote mai-ah tut ngam ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Misiengthote in leitung mite’ thu a khen ding lamtah na thei sih uh amah? Leitung thu khen ding na hi uleh, note in tua bang thu neute na khenla talawm uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thu maimaite gen tah lo, eite pen vantung mite’ thu a khen ding i hi lam thei lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua bang thu maimaite na nei ciengun note in hlattuom pawlpi sunga kithusim lo mite thu na khensah uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami pen na maizum nading vua kang gen ahi hi. No thu um mi khatlekhat kikal thukhen dingin note lahah a pil koima a op lo pen a pieng thei ding ma amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua hi napi-in, thu um mi khat in thu um mi khat ma tawh thu kinei-in zum na kitut vua, thu um lote mai-ah tua danin kiheh hi lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tahtahin khatlekhat na kithunei uh pen note adingin guollelna hi zo ta hi. Bang dingin khiel tang zaw mai lo na hi uh ahei? Bang dingin sol thuoh zaw mai lo na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin noma ma kisu-in na kisol vua, thu umte tungah zong tua bangin na bawl tazang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Migilote in Pasien’ manggam a luo thei lo ding lam na thei sih uh amah? Mi solin om sih un! Numei tawh a pahtatte, milim biete, angkawmte, pasal kizuate, pasal le pasal pahtatte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi gutate, mi huoihamte, zukhamte, mi gensiete, le mi neisa lahpiehte in Pasien’ manggam a luo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note kimkhat tam bang na hi ngai uhi. Hizongnanle i Topa Jesu Khris’ min le eite Pasien’ Hlagau ziehin note pen sawpsieng le siensuo na hi ta vua, dih na tang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Bangkim sep thei nading thu ka nei mawh vangin bangkim sep ding a kilawm tuom sih hi. “Bangkim sep thei nading thu ka nei mawh vangin tuate khatpo’ uhna sungah ka om tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“An pen gilpi ading ahi a, gilpi zong an ading ma ahi hi.” Pasien in tua tegel a nipi-in susie ding hi. Pumpi pen numei-pasal pahtatna-a zah ding ahi sih a, Topa adinga zah ding ahi zaw hi, Topa zong pumpi ading ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasien in Topa thosah a, ama in eite zong a vanglietna tawh ei thosah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na pumpi uh Khris’ pumpi’ nate ahi lam na thei sih uh amah? Tua ahi tah ziehin Khris pumpi’ nate khat la-in numei pahtatte pumpi’ nate suohsah ding ka hi amah? Suohsah buong lo e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Numei pahtat nu a va luppi mi poma tua nu tawh pumkhat suoh ahi lam na thei sih uh amah? Bangzieh ahei cile, “Tua ni tegel sa khat a suoh hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hizongle Topa tawh a kigawm mi poma ama tawh hlagau-ah pumkhat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Numei-pasal pahtatna na pel un! Mi khat in a bawl mawna zosie a pumpi pulam ahi hi; hinanle numei tawh pahtat pa pen ama’ pumpi tunga khiel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi sihle na pumpi uh pen Pasien tung pana na nga uh note sunga om Hlagau Siengtho’ biehinnpi ahi hi; note zong noma-a’ na hi lo lam na thei sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note man tawh ang kileisa na hi ta uhi; tua ahi ziehin na pumpi utawh Pasien’ min na thangsah un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in note in lai-a nang giel uh thute tawh kisai-in: “Pasal khat in numei a khoi khah lo ding hoizaw hi,” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hizongle numei pasal pahtatna a tam seng ziehin pasal in ama’ zi, numei in ama’ pasal ciet nei uleh hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasal in a zi a luppi ding a kilawm za-in luppi ding a, tua ma bangin a zi in zong a pasal a luppi ding a kilawm za-in a luppi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen a zi in ama’ pumpi tungah thu nei loin a pasal in a neizaw a, tua ma bangin a pasal in zong ama’ pumpi tungah thu nei loin a zi in a neizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thungen dinga na kipumpieh thei nadingun na thukimna utawh kideh hun ding tawmno khat na bawl khah uleh ci simlo, khatlekhat lupton lo ding po na kideh sih un. Na pumpi kidehlana zieh vua Satan in note ang ze-et zo lo nadingin tua zaw ciengin na lumtonkia pai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam pen thupieh bang hi loin ahi thei banga kang gen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi zosie kei banga a op zawh uleh hoi ka sa hi. Ahi vangin mikim in Pasien tung panin letsong tuomtuom a nei ciet vua, mi khat in tami letsong nga a, adang khat in a tuom khat nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kinunpi a nei nai lote le meigong numeite tunga ka cina-ah keima bangin kinunpi nei loin a op suoh uleh amate adingin hoi ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi zongin a kideh zawh ngap sih uleh kinei zaw uheh. Azieh pen hua-in lanin kitulmaw a op sangin nei ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kinunpi a neisate tungah- kei thupieh hi lo Topa’ thupieh hizaw- zi in a pasal taisan sih heh, ci thu ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(ahi vangin a taisan tah leh pasal nei loin mang suoh heh, tua ahi sihle a pasal tawh kilemkia hinlen), a pasal in a zi khul sih taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Adangte tungah tami thu ka gen hi- Topa gen ahi lo keima gen- thu um mi khatpo in thu um lo mi khat zi-in nei a, tua nu in ama tawh opton ding a thukim nah po leh khul sih taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Numei khat in thu um lo pasal khat nei-in tua pa in tua nu tawh opton ding a thukim nah po leh khul sih taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a zi ziehin thu um lo pasal kisiengthosah a, thu um lo a zi zong a pasal ziehin kisiengthosah hi. Tua hi sih mawh leh na tate uh a bua hi ding a, hinanle tu-a ma bangin amate a siengtho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin thu um lo zaw pen in kikhen ding a nop po leh kikhen uheh; tam bang thu-ah sanggam pa hile, sanggam nu hile a khi a om sih hi. Pasien in eite a kilem dinga ei hlatsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zi aw, na pasal na hutdam thei ding le na hutdam thei lo ding bangci thei na hei? Pasal aw, na zi na hutdam thei ding le na hutdam thei lo ding bangci thei na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangbang hile mikim in Pasien’ hlatna tawh kituohin Topa’ sena bangin a hinkhuo uh zang ciet uheh. Tam thu pen keima in hlattuom pawlpi zosiete tunga ka pieh zui ding ngaina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi khatpo a kihlat hunin teptansa ahi ta amah? Tua pa in a teptanna lim phiet sawm tuon sih heh. Mi khatpo a kihlat hunin teptan lo ahi amah? Tua pa in teptan ding sawm nawn da mai heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Teptanna bangma ahi sih a, teptan lona zong bangma ahi tuon sih hi. Ahi vangin Pasien’ thupiehte zui ding a thupi pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />No mi zosie in ang kihlat huna na op bangbang vua na op ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ang kihlat laitahin nang sila na hi amah? Tua thu tawh kilunghimawsah sin. Suotahna nga phiel nan lacin nidang lai-a sangin tu laitah na dinmun pen hamphatna-in zangzaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azieh pen sila ahi lai-in Topa sunga kihlan poma Topa -a’ hi a, tua bang ma-in a kihlat laitahin a suohta poma zong Khris’ sila ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Note na hi uleh man tawh ang kileisa na hi uhi; mihing pute’ sila suoh sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, ang kihlat lai-a na op dan bangun Pasien tawh na om suoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in Topa kung panin ngahnu siengthote tawh kisai thupieh ka nei sih hi, ahi vangin Topa’ hepina tawh a muontah keima’ ngaisutna kang pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ang tung bai ding hahsatna thute ngaisun lei na op ngai bang vua na op suoh ding uh hoi va ci-in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zi tawh na kipaikan amah? Na kipaikan tah leh kikhen ding sawm sin. Zi nei nai lo na hiei mah? Na hi leh zi sui da in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zi na nei tah leh a khiel na hi sih hi, ngahnu khat in pasal a nei leh zong a khiel ahi tuon sih hi. Ahi vangin kinunpi a neite in tami hinkhuo-ah hamsatna a thuoh ding vua, tua tawh note kang kipelsah nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, tua bang ka ci ciengin a kise hun ang nai mama ta hi, a ci nuom ka hi hi; tu-a kipanin zi neite pen zi nei lo bang danin om uh hinlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a da mite a da lo bang danin, a lungdam mite zong a lungdam lo bang danin kingaisun a, van leite zong bangma nei lo bang danin om uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Leitunga a kivaite zong a kivai lo bang danin om uheh. Azieh pen tam leitung dante a mangthai ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lunghimawna na nei lo ding uh kang deisah hi. Zi nei lopa in Topa a lungkimsah thei nadingin Topa’ vai teng a buoipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hizongle zi nei pa in a zi a lungkimsah thei nadingin leitung vai teng a buoipi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tuaci’n a lunglutna khen ni a kisuo hi. Tuale pasal nei lo numei le ngahnu siengtho in a pumpi ule a lungsim uh a sientho thei nadingin Topa’ thute a buoipi vua, hinanle pasal nei numei in a pasal a lungkimsah thei nadingin leitung nate a buoipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Note’ phattuom nadinga tam thute kang gen ahi a, kang uhcip nop zieh uh hi loin, a kilawm op dan tawh gamta-in Topa tunga na ki-apna uh a khahtan lo nading ka deina ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi khatpo in ama tawh a kikhamsa ahi numei tungah a kilawm loin gamta-in a kingaisut a, a lunggulna a khau seng ziehin a kinunpi sawm leh a lunggul bangin kinunpi taheh; tua pen mawna ahi sih hi. Ama gel kinung uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama’ lungsim sungah a kikhampi nu tenpi lo dingin khautahin khensatin koima’ pau bawl hi lo ama’ lunggulna kideh zo-in a khentatna tunga a dingkip mi khat ahile a kinunpi lo vangin phamaw lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua bang ahile a kikhampi nu a kinunpi pa pen na hoi sem ahi hi; tua nu kinunpi loin a kideh zote hoizaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zi pen a pasal a hin laisie a kikhaukhi ahi hi. A pasal a si leh a dei khatpopo kinunpi thei a, hizongle Topa sung behah hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanle keima ngaisutna-ah pasal nei loin tua bangin om suoh leh a lung nuomzaw ding hi. Tua hi a, kei zong Pasien’ Hlagau nei-in ka kingaisun hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in milim biehna-a kizangsa an tawh kisai-in: “I unpi-un theina i nei uhi,” a ci eite in i thei uhi. Theina in mi a kisatheisah a, itna in mi a kipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi khat in ka thei hi, ci-a a kingaisut leh a thei ding za-a thei nai lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien a it mi poma ama in a na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin milim biehna-ah a kipiesa an nehna tawh kisai-in eite in, “Lei tungah milim om tahtah lo hi,” a ci thu le, “Pasien khat beh simlo adang om lo hi,” a ci thu i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vantungah ahi a, leitungah ahi zongin pasien-te om a, pasien-te le topate tampi tah a om phiel zongin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />eite adingin Pa ahi Pasien khat beh om a, ama panin sil bangkim pieng a, eite zong ama dinga nungta i hi uhi. Topa khat beh om a, ama pen Jesu Khris ahi hi. Ama tungtawnin sil bangkim pieng a, eite zong ama tungtawnin i nungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi zosie in tami theina a nei kim sih uhi. Pawlkhat in milim biehna zongsang luo ta uh ahi ziehin, tua bang ante a neh ciengun tudong ciengin milim kunga kipiesa ci-in a ngaisunsun lai uhi; amau’ kitheina lungsim a thazawm ziehin tua an a bua a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“An in eite Pasien tawh ei kinai sah tuon lo ding hi. I neh lo vangin zong i siezaw tuom sih a, i neh vangin zong i hoizaw tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi zongin tami na suotahna uh pen a thanem mite’ puana a suo khah lo nadingin kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile no thu thei-a kineite in milim biehna inn sunga na an neh uh pen milim biehna sunga an ne dinga amau’ kitheina lungsim lamah a thanemte in hing mu kha ta leh, a tha pie na suoh ta sih ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n note’ theina ziehin amate dinga Khrist in sina a thuohpi, a thanem thu umte in a kisietlaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in na innkuonpite tung vuah tam bangin na maw vua, a tha zawngkhal amau’ kitheina lungsim na liemsah ciengun Khris tungah note zong a maw na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amau’ puana a hang pen ka an nehna zieh ahile amate khat zong ka puasah khah lo nadingin sa kici ka ne ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei a suohta mi hi lo ka mah? Kei sawltahpi khat hi lo ka mah? I Topa Jesu mu zo hi lo ka mah? Note zong Topa sunga ka nasep hi lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Adangte tungah sawltahpi ka hi sih lezong note adingin ka hi buong sam hi; azieh pen Topa sungah sawltahpi ka hina ciemtena pen note na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei ei sittel mite tungah ka kidalna tami ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ko zong neh le dawn nga thei ding ma hi lo ka hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawltahpi dangte, Topa’ naute le Cephas ma bangin ko zong thu um zite a zawpi thei ding hi lo ka hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi sihle ka neh suina uh nasepna panin keima le Banabas beh a awngtang thei lo ka hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama’ sum tawh galkap na a sem koi ahei? Lengga kung suon napi a ga khat zong a ne lo koi ahei? Ahi sihle gan khawi napi a nawi a dawn lo koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam thu teng mihing thuneina tawh ang gen ka hi amah? Thukham in zong tam bang ma-in gen hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen Moses’ thukham sungah, “Bawngtangin bu a cil laitahin a nephu na hen sih ding uhi,” ci-in kigiel hi. Bawngtang adingin Pasien a lunghimaw amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi sihle eite ading ngiet a a gen hi lo amah? Eite ading ma-a a giel ngiet ahi hi. Bangzieh ahei cile lo hlo mi poma in lametna tawh lo kai a, ancil mi poma in zong a nga ding lametna tawh an a cil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note lahah hlagau khaici hing vaw zo ka hi ziehun no tung panin na leitung’ nate ka at ule zong a tam seng ahi ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midangte in note tungah thu a nei thei leh kote in a tamzaw ka nei thei lai sam sih ding uh amah? Hizongle kote in tami thuneina zang loin, Khris’ lungdamna thu a kikhahtan lo nadingin na khatpopo ka thuoh kenkon zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Biehinnpi sunga nasemte in biehinnpi panin neh a nga vua, maitam-a nasemte in zong maitam tunga kiluite a nga lam uh thei lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ma bangin lungdamna thu a tangkote in lungdamna thu panin kivana a nga ding uhi, ci-in Topa in thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hizongle tam bang nga thei dingte khat zong ka zang sih a, keima tunga tamte ang kizah nadinga tami lai ang giel zong ka hi sih hi. Koima in keima’ kisahtheina a hang a susie vawt sih ding hi, tua bang sangin ka sizaw bawn ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lungdamna thu ka tangko ziehin kisiel nading thu mawngmawng ka nei sih hi, bangzieh ahei cile tua thu a hil ding ma a ka tunga mawpuoh ei kisuon ahi bo hi. Lungdamna thu ka tangko sih leh gimna ka thuoh ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen keima nop thu-a sem hi leng sep thaman ka nei ding hi; ahi vangin keima nop thu-a sem ka hi sihle tua pen sep dinga ei kingansie na a sem ka hi lel bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahile ka thaman ding bang ahiei? Ka thugennate-ah lungdamna thu sunga ka nga ding hamphatnate zang sieng loin, a man ngen loin lungdamna thu ka tangkona pen keima’ thaman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile koima’ sila ka hi sih vangin mi a tam theithei ka nga thei nadingin mi zosie’ sila ka kisuohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jew mite ka nga thei nadingin Jew mite kungah Jew mi khat bang ka suoh hi. Thukham khut nei-a om mite ka nga thei nadingin (kei mama thukham nei-ah om lo napi) thukham nei-a omte tungah thukham nei-a om bangin ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thukham nei lote ka nga zawh nadingin (Pasien’ thukham panin a suohta hi tuon loin Khris’ thukham nei-a a om hizaw nanleng) thukham nei lote lahah thukham nei lote khat bangin ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thanem mite ka nga thei nadingin a thanem mite lahah a thanem bangin ka om hi. Lam khatpopo tawh mi pawlkhat ka hutdam thei nadingin mi zosie adingin sil bangkim ka suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lungdamna thuphate-ah tanh ka nga thei nadingin lungdamna thu ziehin tam thu zosie ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tai kidemna-ah mi zosie a tai vangin khat beh in patawina a nga lam thei lo na hi uh amah? Note in zong patawina na nga nadingun tua bangin tai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kidemna-a a kihal dingte in na vannuoi-ah amau le amau a kideh uhi; amate ahi ule a kisie thei paakuol nga nadinga kidem ahi bo vua, ahi vangin eite i hi uleh a kisie thei lo paakuol nga dinga a kidem i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n ngimna nei loin ka tai sih a, hui lah a mawh tuptup bang zong ka hi sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ahi vangin keima in midangte tungah thu ka hil zaw ciengin kidemna-ah a kihal zo lo ka suo khah lo nadingin ka pumpi helbawl gawpin ka thuthu ka mangsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, meiipi nei-ah i pu i pate na omin a unpi-un san tuipi a na kantan vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />amate a unpi-un meeipi le tuipi sung Moses kungah a na ki-baptize uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in a unpi-un a kibang hlagau an a ne vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a unpi ma-un a kibang hlagau tui a dawn ciet uhi. Azieh pen amate in a nua a zui uh hlagau suongpi panin tui a dawn uhi, tua suongpi pen Khris ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanle amate a tamzaw tungah Pasien lungkim lo ahi ziehin gamlahah a kisatlia sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate bangin eite in thusie i lunggul lo nadingin eite’ ette dinga tami thute ang pieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ne ding dawn dingin mipite a to vua, a lam dingin a dingto uhi,” ci-in a kigiel ma bangin amate kimkhat in a bieh bangun milim biete na suoh sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate kimkhat in a numei pasal pahtatna a bawl vua, ni khat thu-in mi tul sawm ni le tul thum a si bangun eite in numei pasal pahtatna i bawl poma sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate kimkhat in Khris na ze-et uh ahi ziehin gul in a na tuhkia bangin i ze-et sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate kimkhat bangin phunphun sih un, tuaci’n a susie pa in a amate a susie sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pieng tam thute pen etsahna dingin amate tunga na pieng ahi a, leitung tawpkuon hun sunga a om eite hil nadinga na kigiel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n a dingkip a na kingaisut leh na pua lo nadingin kidawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note tungah mi zosie tunga a tung ngai lo ze-etna ang tung sih ding hi. Pasien pen a thuman ahi a, ama in na thuoh zawh lo uh ze-etna ang thuohsah sih ding hi. Note in na thuoh zawh nadingun tua ze-etna panin suotah nading lampi zong ang bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka lawm itte aw, milim biehna panin na tai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thu ngaisun theite kunga gen banga kang gen ahi hi. Ka gen thute noma mama in khentel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eite in lungdam i ko uh tua lungdamna hai khu Khris’ sisan sunga i kihalna uh hi lo amah? Eite in i balnen uh ahi tua khomun i nehna uh zong khu Khris’ pumpi sunga i kihalna uh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile khomun lum khat om a, eite zosie in tua khomun lum khat i nehton ziehun, a tampi ahi eite pumkhat i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mite thu ngaisun un. Biehpiehna an a ne mite pen maitam tawh kipawl hi lo uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahile bang gen nuom ka hi ahei? Milim biehna ante thupi a ci ka mah? Ahi sihle milim biehna thupi a ci ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi lo hi, ka gen nop thu in, lawkite’ kithoina pen dawite tunga a kithoina uh ahi bo a, Pasien tunga a biehpiehna uh ahi sih hi. Dawite tawh na kipawl ding uh ka dei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa’ hai le dawite’ hai na dawnton thei sih ding uhi. Note in Topa’ sabuoi le dawite’ sabuoi ah an na imton thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi sihle eite in Topa’ hazatna a sosah ding i hi uh amah? Ama sangin i hatzaw uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Bangkim sep thei nading thu a op vangin bangkim phattuomna hi tuon lo hi. Bangkim sep thei nading thu a op vangin bangkim in ei kipsah tuon lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Noma’ phattuom nading beh sui loin mi dangte phattuom nading suizaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A sie le a pha theina lungsim ziehin bangma dong vateh loin sa zuana-a kizua sa khat popo ne lel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azieh pen, “Leitung le a sunga sil bangkim Topa -a’ ahi hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thu um lo mi khat in an ne dingin ang hlat a, haw na sawm leh lungsim kisuonna a op lo nadingin na mai-a kilui popo dong loin ne suh lel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi khatpo in na kungah, ‘Tami milim biehna sa ahi hi,’ ang ci leh tua ang gen mipa na khuolna le a sie le a pha theina lungsim ziehin na ne da mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kitheina lungsim ka ci ciengin nang-a’ beh a ci nuom ka hi sih a, adangte-a’ zong a ci nuom ka hi hi. Ka suotahna pen bang dingin midang khat’ kitheina lungsim in thu khensah laizang ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lungdamna tawh ka neh leh lungdam ko-a ka nehna ziehin bang dingin ei kigensie ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaci’n nehna dawnna-a kipanin na sil bawl poma uh bangkimah Pasien’ minthan nadingin na bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jew mite ahi a, Greek-te ahi a, Pasien’ hlattuom pawlpi ahi zongin lungkhamsah sih unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />amate hutdam ahi thei nadingun ka sepna bangkimah keima’ phattuom nading sui loin, mi zosie’ phattuom nading sui-in, mikim lungkim nading ka hanciem ma bangin no zong na hanciem un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khris ka ette bangin kei ei ette un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na vannuoi-ah kei ei phawhin note tunga kang piehsawn tang ngainate na zui ziehun kang pahta mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi zosie’ lutang pen Khris hi a, zi’ lutang pen pasal hi-in, Khris’ lutang pen Pasien ahi hi, ci thu note in na thei ding uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lutuom kawmin thu ngenin kam a sang pasal poma pen a lutang daisah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin numei khatpo in lu tuom loin thu ngenin kam a san leh tua pen a lutang’ daisah ahi a, a sam kimettol numei tawh kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile numei in a lu a tuom sih ding leh a sam a heu ding ahi hi. Sam heu ding ahi a, a met tol ding ahi zongin zumhuoi a sah leh a lu a tuom ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen pasal pen Pasien’ lim le mel kilahna ahi ziehin a lu a tuom ding a kilawm sih hi. Hinanle numei pen pasal’ mel kilahna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tahtahin cilei numei panin pasal kipiengsah lo a, pasal pana numei kipieng sah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Numei adinga pasal kipiengsah hi lo a, pasal adinga numei kipiengsah hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami thu zieh le vantung mite ziehin numei in a lu tungah thu a kineina lim a nei dingin kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangbang hitale Topa sungah pasal loin numei tuomdin zo lo a, pasal zong numei lo-in tuomdin zo tuon lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen pasal panin numei a pien ma bangin pasal zong numei sung pana pieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No le no thu kikhen un: Numei khat in a lu tuom loin Pasien kunga thu a nget ding a kilawm amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasal in a sam a sausah leh zumhuoi hi, ci thu leitung pienzie mama in zong ang hil uh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanlezong numei a sam a sau leh ama’ minthanna hi lo amah? Azieh pen ama’ sam sau pen a kituom nadinga kipie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanle tami thu a niel nuom a op khah leh eite in tua bang ngaina i nei sih vua, Pasien’ hlattuom pawlpite in zong a nei tuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu-in a nei-a kithuhilnate-ah note kang pahta sih hi. Bangzieh ahei cile na kikhop ciengun hoina hi loin sietna hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a masa penah hlattuom pawlpi khat banga na kikhop ciengun note lahah kikhennate om hi, ci ka za a, tua pen bangtan cieng ahiei khat man dingin ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A tahtahin note lahah kikhenna a om ding ma ahi hi, azieh pen tua bang cieng ma behin note lahah a tahtah teng ang kitel pan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na kikhop uh cienga na neh uh pen Topa’ nitah an ne tahtah na hi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a hun a tun ciengin noma’ an ciet na kineh masah vua, pawlkhat gilkielin adang pawlkhat zukhamin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua khu bang bep ahei! Na neh na dawn nading uh inn nei lo na hi uh amah? Tua ahi sihle Pasien’ hlattuom pawlpi simmaw-in bangma nei lote a zumsisah nuom na hi uh amah? Note kungah bang hing gen leng kilawm ding ahei? Note kang pahta ding amah? Tami thu-ah kang pahta vawt sih ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa tung pana ka nga, note tunga kang gensawn thu in, ama a kileheh ni zan-in Topa Jesu in khomun la-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />lungdam a ko zaw ciengin phalsuo a, “Tami in note adinga a kipie ka pumpi ahi hi. Kei nei phaw nadingun tam bangin na bawl un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ma bangin nitah an a neh zaw ciengun hai la a, “Tami hai in ka sisan sunga thuciemna tha ahi hi. Tam banga na dawn sielun kei nei phaw nadingun na bawl un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note in tami khomun ne-in hai na dawn sielun ama ang pei masangsie Topa’ sina a tangkoko na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a kilawm lopi-in khomun ne-in Topa’ hai a dawn poma Topa’ pumpi le a sisan tungah a maw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />No le no kisittel phot unlen, tua zaw cieng behin khomun ne-in hai dawn pan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama’ pumpi telcien lopi-a a ne a dawn poma in ama tungah thukhenna a tun nadinga a ne a dawn ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua thu ziehin note lahah mi tampi zawngkhalin a dammaw vua, mi pawlkhat in a silaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin ei le ei thu i kikhen zo tah leh thukhenna i thuoh ta sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanle Topa in thu ei khen ciengin leitung mite tawh mawsah thukhenna i thuoh lo nadinga eite thu ei kihil ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin sanggamte aw, Topa’ nitah an ne dinga na kikhop ciengun khatlekhat na kingah bo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua banga na kikhop uh ciengin mawsah thukhenna na thuoh lo nadingun, na gil uh a kiel leh na inn vuah an ne masa un. Keima kang tun ciengin thudangdang teng kang hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, tu-in hlagau letsongte tawh kisai thu na thei lo ding uh ka dei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lawki na hi lai-un a ham thei lo milimte opna munah note ang kizawlin ang kipuimang lam na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Pasien’ Hlagau tawh thu gen koima in, “Jesu kisamsie heh!” ci ngai lo a, Hlagau Siengtho hang longal tawh koima in, “Jesu in Topa hi,” a ci thei lo lam na thei ding uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu-in ahile letsong tuomtuom a op vangin Hlagau a kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nasepna tuomtuom a op vangin Topa a kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sil bawlna tuomtuom a op vangin mi zosie sungah tuate zosie ei semsah Pasien a kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mikim’ hoi nadingin mi zosie tungah Hlagau kilahna kipie ciet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua Hlagau tungtawnin mi khat tungah pilna kipie a, tua Hlagau ma tawh adang khat tungah thu theina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />adang khat tungah tua Hlagau ma tawh upna kipie a, adang khat tungah tuami Hlagau ma tawh cina damsah theina letsongte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />adang khat tungah na lamdang bawl theina, adang khat tungah kamsan theina, adang khat tungah hlate khentel theina, adang khat tungah ham nam tuomtuomte ham theina, adang khat tungah tua hamte a khietna gen theina ci bangin kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam teng zosie a kibang hlagau khat guoh nasep ahi a, ama’ deina bangin mimal khat ciet tungah a hawmpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile pumpi pen khat ahi a, tua in nate tampi nei hi. Pumpi’ na zosie tampi a phah vangin pumpi khat beh hi a, Khris zong tua ma bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen Jew mite ahi a, Greek-te ahi zongin, silate ahi a, sila lote ahi zongin, eite i unpi-un Hlagau khat in pumpi khat sungah ei baptize zo ta hi. Eite i unpi-un Hlagau khat a dawnton dingin ei kibawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tahtahin pumpi in na khat beh nei loin tampi tawh kibawl hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keng in, “Khut ka hi lo ziehin pumpi-a’ ka hi sih hi,” ci leh tua a cina lel tawh pumpi’ nate khat ahi khiem tuon lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale bil in, “Mittang ka hi lo ziehin pumpi-a’ ka hi sih hi,” ci leh tua a ci na lel tawh pumpi’ nate khat ahi khiem tuon lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pumpi zosie mittang hi sieng leh khuozah theina ding hei sungah a om ta ding ahei? Pumpi zosie khuozah theina hi sieng ta leuleu leh zong a gimnam zah theina ding hei sungah a om ta ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanle Pasien in ama’ deiteel bangin pumpi sungah tua nate a guong kim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A unpi-un pumpi’ na khat beh hi sieng leh pumpi hei-ah om ta ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi bang cietun pumpi’ na tampi a op vangin pumpi khat beh a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mittang in khut kungah, “Nang kang tulmaw sih hi,” a ci thei sih a, lutang in zong keng kungah, “Nang kang tulmaw sih hi,” a ci thei tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale mahin a thanem zaw tawh a kibang pumpi’ nate pen a kitulmaw teng hi thei zaw a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />i thupi sim khol lo pumpi’ nate pen i nah patawite hi thei zawsop hi. I zatah khol lo nate zong nahpi taha i zatahte hi thei zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kilawm i sah i pumpi’ nate a kisam lo zawteng ahi hi. Ahi vangin Pasien in tua bangin pumpi a lem dinga a na bawl ahi a, ama in a gina lo nate a patawi huoi zaw-in na koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n pumpi sungah kithutuo lona ci om loin pumpi nate khatlekhat a kikep ciet thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khat in gimna a thuoh leh a unpi-un thuohton cietin khat in patawina a nga leh zong a unpi-un a lungdamton ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu-in note pen Khris’ pumpi na hi vua, mi khat ciet zong pumpi’ nate na hi kim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien in hlattuom pawlpi sungah a masa penin sawltahpite, a nina-ah kamsangte, a thumna-ah lai hilte, tua ciengin na lamdang bawlte, tua ciengin cina damsah theina letsong ngate, mi hu theite, vaihawm makaite, ham nam tuomtuom ham theite ci bangin a se hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A unpi-un sawltahpite ahi uh amah? A unpi-un kamsangte ahi uh amah? A unpi-un thuhil siete ahi uh amah? A unpi-un na lamdang a bawl uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A unpi-un cina damsahna letsongte a nei uh amah? A unpi-un ham tuomtuomte a ham uh amah? A unpi-un a khietna a gen uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in a thupizaw letsongte na nga thei nadingun na hanciem un. Keima in a thupizaw lai lampi note kang lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihingte’ ham le vantung mite’ hamin thu gen phiel ma nanleng itna ka nei sih leh zampi ginsie le daltuo ging bang lel ka hi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in kamsan theina nei-in thuthuh zosie le theina zosie zong nei-in, muolte kinsah zawh nading upna ka nei phiel ta zongin itna ka nei sih leh kei bangma ka hi tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima in ka neisa zosie hawm siengin ka kisiel nadingin ka pumpi pie phiel nanleng zong itna ka nei sih leh phattuomna a om tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Itna in lungduoi-in migi hi; itna in thangsie loin a kipha sah sih a, zong a kiliensah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Itna in a ama’ ang sung ding beh a khuoltentun sih a, lungthah bai loin mi’ mawna ciemte lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuman lote kipahpi loin thuman thutahah a kipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Itna in thu zosie puo zo a, thu zosie zong um hi. Na vannuoi lamen a, na zosie thuoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Itna in tawp hun nei lo hi. Ahi vangin kamsannate mangthai ding hi; kamtuom hamte khawl ding hi; theinate zong tawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen eite in a bukim loin i thei vua, a bukim loin kam i sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin a bukim thu ang tun ciengin a bukim lo pen maimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Naupang ka hi lai-in, naupang bangin thu ka gen a, naupang bangin thu ngaisunin naupang bangin ka lungngai hi; ahi vangin ka khangham ciengin naupang vai teng ka tawpsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tu-in eite in limlang a et bangin kicien loin ahi milmielin i mu bep vua, hinanle khum hun tah ciengin kimaituo-in i mu ding uhi. Tu-in a bukim loin ka thei hi; khum hun ciengin a kicing a ei kithei bangin ken zong a bukimin ka thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale tu-in upna, lametna, le itna tam teng thum a om den uhi. Tam teng lahah a thupi pen itna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Itna del unlen, hlagau letsongte lunggul un, adiehin kamsang a thugenna lunggul pen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kamsang a thugente in mihingte kunga thugen hi loin Pasien kunga thugen ahi zaw uhi; azieh pen amate in hlagau sungah thuthuhpite a gen ziehun koima in amau’ thugen a theithei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin kamsang thu hilte pen midangte’ kilam nading, a kihanthot nading le a kihenep nading vua thugen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kamtuom tawh a hamte in amau le amau kikipsah ahi a, ahi vangin kamsang a thu hilte in hlattuom pawlpi a kipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in na unpi-un kamtuom tawh na ham ding uh ka dei a, hinanle kamsang a thu na hil ding uh ka deizaw pehpeh hi. Hlattuom pawlpi a kilam nadingin mi khat in kamtuom a thuhil pa’ thugen a phenpieh sih leh ama sangin kamsang a thuhil pa a thupizaw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in sanggamte aw, na kung vua kang haw ciengin kamtuom tawh thu hing genin, kilahna ahi a, theina ahi zongin, kamsanna ahi a, thuhilnate ahi zongin kimkhat hing gen sih mawh leng bangci bangin note hing phatuomsah ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinna a nei lo tum thei vante ahi theile, harp lasahnate zong tua bang ma ahi uhi. A aw cientahin hing ging sih mawh leh bang awkaih tawh kitum ahei, ci pen koi-in theithei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pengkul zong kicientahin ging sih leh galsim dingin koi kithawi thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note zong tua bang ma na hi uhi; note in a kithei lo ham tawh thugen locin na thugen uh koi in bangci theithei ding ahei? Bangzieh ahei cile hui lahah thugen na hi lel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leitungah kamham nam tuomtuom tampi om tahpi a, a khietna nei lo khat beh a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin kamham a khietna ka thei sih leh thugen pa adingin kei pen gamdang mi ka suoh a, thugen pa zong kei adingin gamdang mi a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note zong tua ma bang na hi uhi; note in Hlagau letsongte lunggulin na nei tah ngalun hlattuom pawlpi a kilamkip nadingin a thupizawte nei ding na hanciem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin kamtuom tawh thu gen mi in a khietna a gen thei nadingin thu ngen heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kamtuom tawh thu ngen leng ka hlagau tawh thu ngen ka hi vangin ka lungsim in phattuomna a nga sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahile bang ka law ta diei? Keima in hlagau tawh thu ka ngen ding a, ahi vangin lungsim tawh zong thu ka ngen ding hi; keima in hlagau tawh la ka sa ding a, ahi vangin lungsim tawh zong la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua bang ahi sihle na hlagau tawh lungdam na ko ciengin pulam mi khatpo in na lungdam kona-a na thugente a thei lo ziehin bangci bangin “Amen’ ci thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang na hile hoitaha lungdam a ko na hi kha ding a, ahi vangin tua in midangte a kipsah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima in note zosie sangin kamtuom tawh thu gen theizaw ka hi ziehin Pasien tungah ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hizongle hlattuom pawlpi sungah midangte thuhil nadingin kamtuom teng tul sawm ka ham sangin a kithei kamteng nga ka gen nuomzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, na thu ngaisutna vuah naupang bang sih un; gitlona lamah ahi thei tanin nausen bang unlen, ahi vangin thu ngaisutna lamah khanghamte bang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thukham laibu sungah, “A lamdang mite’ ham le gamdang mite’ ham tawh tam mite tungah thu ka gen ding a, tua cieng nangawnin zong amate in ka thugente a ngai sih ding uhi,” ci-in kigiel hi, Topa in a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin kamtuomte pen thu um mite adingin lim hi loin thu um lo mite ading hizaw hi. Tua ma bangin kamsang a thuhilna zong thu um lo mite ading hi loin thu um mite ading hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin hlattuom pawlpi buppi kikhawmin kamtuomte tawh ham cietin, a pulam mite ahi sihle thu um lo mite hing lut uleh mimaw lomtang hi bo, ang ci sih ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note in na unpi-un kamsang a thu na hil laitahun thu um lo mi khat ahi a, pulam mi khat ahi zongin hing lut leh mi zosie in tua pa a mawsah ding vua, mi zosie in ama’ khielna a kiphawhsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thu um lo mipa’ lungtang sunga a thusimte kipholah zaw ciengin, Pasien mai-ah tua pa kunin bie-in, “Note lahah Pasien om tahtah hi,” ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin ka lawmte aw, bang bawl ding i hei? Note na kikhop ciengun biehna la khat ahiei, hil ding khat ahiei, kilahna khat ahiei, kamtuom khat ahiei, a khietna genna khat ahiei, khat ta na nei ciet uhi. Sil bangkim kilamkip nadingin na zang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi khatpo in kamtuom tawh thu a gen leh mi ni ahi sihle a tam pen mi thum in khat zaw khat a banbanin gen beh hinlen khat in kamphen taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kamphen ding koima a op sih leh kikhopna sungah kamtuom tawh a gen dingte sip dide uh hinlen, amau le amau Pasien tawh kiho ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kamsang ni ahi sihle thum bang in thu gen hinlen, adang teng in a kigente khinkhai uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A gei-a to midang khat tungah Pasien kilahna a tun leh thugen masa pa sip phot heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mi zosie in thu a thei nading ule a kihanthawn thei nadingun na unpi-un khat zaw khat a banbanin kamsangin thu na hil thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kamsangte’ hlate kamsangte’ uhna nei-ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien pen buoina Pasien hi loin kilemna Pasien hizaw hi. (Misiengte’ hlattuom pawlpi zosie-ah a kizah dan bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />biehinn sungah numeite sip dide uheh. Bangzieh ahei cile amate a thu gen ding uh a kiphal sih a, thukham in zong a gen ma bangin amate pen uhna nei-a om ding hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in thei nop khatpo a nei uleh inn ah a pasal ciet uh dong ta uheh. Azieh pen hlattuom pawlpi sungah numei khat in thu a gen ding a zumhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahi sihle no tung pana Pasien’ thu hing kipan amah? Ahi sihle Pasien’ thu tunna no beh na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mi khatpo, kamsang ahi sihle hlagau vanglietna nei bang khata a kingaisut leh ama in na kung vua kang gielte Topa’ thupiehin sang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mi khatpo in tam thute a thudon sih leh ama zong thudon da pai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka lawmte aw, note in kamsang a thuhil ding lunggul penin na nei unlen, kamtuom tawh thugen zong na kham sam sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahi vangin sil bangkim a kilawm a kituoha bawl ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in sanggamte aw, note kunga kang gen, note in zong na sansa ule kiptaha na dinpisa uh lungdamna thute na phawkia ding uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in na kung vua kang gen thute note in hoitaha na tuhkip nah uleh lungdamna thu tungtawnin gupna nga na hi vua, tua ahi sihle na upna uh a mawhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a thupi masa penin keima in ka sansa kang hopsawn thu in tami ahi hi: Lai Siengtho in a gen ma bangin eite’ mawna tangin Khris in sina thuoh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama kivui-in Lai Siengtho in a gen bangin a ni thum ni-in thokia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Peter tungah kilahin tua ciengin sawm le nite kungah kilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin sanggam za nga sanga a tamzawte tungah thakhatin kilah a, tuate lahah pawlkhat a si zo tah vangun a tamzaw in ei hinpi lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin James kungah ama kilah a, tua ciengin sawltahpite zosie kungah zong kilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nukhia penin a hun cing lopi-a a suoh nausen tawh a kibang keima kungah ang kilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kei pen sawltahpite lahah a gina lo pen ka hi a, Pasien’ hlattuom pawlpi ka bawlsiet ziehin sawltahpi ci dingin zong a kilawm ka hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien’ hepina ziehin kei pen ka hi bang ka hi a, ama in kei tunga ei pieh a hepina pen a mawhna suoh lo hi. Tuale mahin amate khatpo sangin zong nasep ka hakat zaw a, - tua khu kei sep hi sih nanle - keima ei ompi Pasien’ hepina in a sep ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahile keima ka hi a, amate ahi zongin tua bangin thu ka hil vua, note in zong tua bang ma-in na um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in sina panin Khris thokia zo hi, ci-in kihil zo ahile no pawlkhat in bangci dan a misite’ thawkiana om lo hi, ci thei na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misite thawkiana om lo hi leh Khris zong a kithosah lo hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khris a kithosah lo khat hi poma leh ka thugenna uh a mawhna suoh ding a, na upna uzong a mawhna ma suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Misite thokia lo hi, ci thu a man tahpi leh Pasien in Khris zong a thosah lo ahi hi. Pasien in sina panin Khris thosahkia zo hi, ci-in teci ka pan ziehun kote nangawn zong Pasien thu’ a man lopi-a genin ei kimu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile misite thokia lo hi leh Khris zong a thokia lo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khris a thokia lo hi leh na upna uh a thawn hi ding a, na mawna sung vua omlai na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Khris sunga a sisa mite zong a mangthai sieng ahi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khris sungah tami hinkhuo ading beha lametna nei i hi uleh mi zosie lahah a hepihuoi pen i hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanle sina panin Khris thokia tahtah zo a, a sisa mite lah panin ga masa pen ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen mi khat ziehin sina a tun ma bangin mi khat tungtawn ma-in misite thawkiana a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Adam sungah mi zosie a si bangin Khris sungah mi zosie kihingsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hizongle a hun ciet uh zui-in hi ding hi: Khris ahile ga masa pen hi a, ama ang peikia ciengin Khris-a’ teng a hingkia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin tawpna hun ang tung ding a, ama in vaihawmte zosie, thuneite zosie, le vanglietna zosie a suhsiet zaw ciengin Pa Pasien kungah kumpi gam a ap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in a galte zosie a keng nei-ah a koi masangsie vai a hawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kisusie ding gal nukhia pen sina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Azieh pen, “Pasien in ama’ keng nei-ah sil bangkim koi zo hi,” kici hi. Hinanle, “Ama’ keng nei-ah sil bangkim kikoi zo hi,” a ci ciengin Khris’ nei-ah sil bangkim a koi Pasien a huom khah lo lam kitel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khris’ khut nei-ah sil bangkim a kikoi ciengin Pasien pen sil bangkim ah sil bangkim ahi thei nadingin a khut nei-a sil bangkim a koi Pasien’ khut nei-ah Tapa mama zong a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua hi sih mawh leh misite tanga ki-baptize mite in bang a bawl ta ding vuoi? Misite a thokia lo hi leh amate tangin bang dingin mite ki-baptize uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuale bang dingin ko le ko a nai simin kizausah den uh ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, note ziehin i Topa Jesu Khris sungah ka kisahthei zakhat ma bangin nisimin sina a thuohthuoh ka hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihing lametna maimai tawh hi leh Ephesus khuo-a gamsate tawh ka kibawna bang phattuompi leltah ding ka hei? Misite kithosah lo hi leh, “Zing cienga si ding i hi tah ziehun kineh kidawn va vui,” i ci lel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mi kisolsah sih un: “Kigoppi hoi lo in opdan hoite siesah hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hoitahin thu ngaisun pha unlen na maw nawn sih un; bangzieh ahei cile mi kimkhat in Pasien thu a thei sih uhi. Keima in na maizum nading vua kang gen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi pawlkhatte in, “Misite bangci danin ang thokia ding uh ahei? Bangci pumpi tawh ang tho ding uh ahei?” ci-in ang dong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mimaw pa! Na khaici tu pen a si phot sih leh a hing thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua na tu khaici khu ang po ding pen ahi sih a, mangbu hile, adang khatpo hile a tang tahtah na tuzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama’ teelsa bangin Pasien in a kung posah a, khaici namciet ah ama’ kung ciet a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sa zosie zong a kibangkim sih a, mihing sa, ganhing sa, va sa, nga sa, ci bangin a nam tuomtuom a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Van pumpite om a, lei pumpite zong a om hi, ahi vangin van pumpite’ thupina nam khat hi a, lei’ pumpite’ thupina a tuom khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ni in thupina nam khat nei a, hlapi in thupina a tuom khat nei-in, aasite in zong a tuom khat ma nei uhi; a tahtahin ci leih aasi khat le khat zong a thupina kilamdang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Misite thawkiana zong tua ma bang ahi hi. A kitu pen a sie thei hi a, a thokia pen a sie thei lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A melsie-in kitu a, a mel hoi-in ang thokia hi. A thanemin kitu a, a vanglienin ang thokia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tahsa pumpi kitu a, hla pumpi-in ang thokia hi. Tahsa pumpi om ahile hla pumpi zong a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin, “Mi masa Adam pen hinna a nei mi khat ang suoh hi,” ci-in kigiel hi; hizongle a nukhia Adam pen hinna a pie hlagau a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ahi vangin hla pumpi om masa lo a, tahsa pumpi om masa-in tua ciengin hla pumpi a om ahi na bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi masapen pa leitung pan ahi a, leivui tawh kibawl mi ahi hi; a nina pa pen vantung pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Leivui-a kisiem mite pen leivui pana kisiem pa ma tawh kibang a, van mite pen vantung pana ang peipa ma tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Eite in leivui-a kibawl mihing mel i puoh ma bangin vanmi mel zong i puo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, na kung vua kang gennop pen tami thu ahi hi: Tahsa le sisan in Pasien’ manggam a luo thei sih a, a kisie theite in a kisie thei lote a luo thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ngai un, thuthuh khat kang gen ding hi! Eite zosie a si sieng ding i hi sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />pengkul nukhia pen ang gin ciengin mitphet kal bano khat sungin i unpi-un i kikhel sieng ding uhi. Azieh pen pengkul ang ging ding a, a sisa mite a sie thei nawn lo dingin ang tho ding a, eite i kikhel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tami a sie thei pumpi in siet thei lona sil ta ding a, tami a si thei pumpi in zong si thei lona sil ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tami a sie thei pumpi in siet thei lona silin, tami a si thei pumpi in si thei lona a sil ciengin, “Guol zawna sungah sina kival tum zo hi,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />“Sina aw, na gu hei-ah a om ta a, sina aw, na guolzawna hei-ah a om ta ahei?” ci-a a kigielsa thu ang tangtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Sina gu in mawna hi a, mawna’ vanglietna in thukham ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ahi vangin i Topa Jesu Khris tungtawna guolzawna ei pie Pasien tungah lungdam i ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin kang itte aw, kiptahin dingin kilawh sih unlen, note in Topa sunga na nasepna uh a mawhna a hi lo lam thei na hi ziehun Topa’ nasepna ah a hoi thei penin ma na pang zing un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in misiengthote ading sumpi kaikhopna tawh kisai-in: Galati pawlpite in a zui ding uh thu ka piehsa bangin note in zong na bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima kang haw ciengin sumpi kaikhoptawm a a kisam lo dingin nipi kal khat sungah a ni masa ni-in khat ciet in na sum nga uh a val popo na tuomkoi unlen na khol un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kang tun ciengin Jerusalem ah na letsongte uh a puoh dingin pha na sah uh mi khatpo sawlin lai tawh kang peisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei zong ka va pei ding hoi i sah leh amate tawh ka va kithuo ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Macedonia gam nawhin khuolzin sawm ka hi ziehin Macedonia gam ka zin zaw ciengin na kung vuah kang haw ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ka khuolzinna ka peina khat popo-ah nei panpi thei nadingun na kung vuah bakhat sung ahi sihle phalbi sung nangawn kang tam thei kha mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tu-in note kungah ang lambang pahin i kimu ding ka nuom sih hi. Topa’ awina a op leh note tawh bakhat sung i opton ding ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pentecost pawi dong Ephesus khuo ah ka tam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ei langpang mi tampi a op tei vangin kei adingin a lawcing nasep theina kot a golpi-in kihong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Timothy ang haw khah leh ama zong keima banga Topa’ na sem ahi tah ziehin note lahah bangma pautau loin a op nadingin na vaihawmpi un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin koima na simmawsah sih un. Ama kei kunga ang kilekia thei nadingin a lampi-ah nuomtahin na hla un; azieh pen a sanggamte tawh ama ang zawhton dingin ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in i sanggam pa uh Apollos tawh kisai-in, keima in sanggam dangte tawh na kung vua ang haw nadingin nahpi-in ka hanthawn hi. Ahi vangin tu tadi-a ang haw pai ding pen a lunglut nai sih hi. Hun lemtang a nga ciengin ama ang haw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilvangin upna-ah dingkip unlen hangsanin thahat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na sep na bawlna zosie vuah itna tawh sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, tu-in Stephanas’ innkuon pen Achaia gama thu um masa pente ahi vua, amate mama zong misiengthote’ nasepna-ah kipumpieh uhi, ci na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note in tua bang mite le amate tawh a semton mi zosie’ thu na man dingun kang hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na op lo sung uh awng hu pah dingin Stephanas, Fortunatus le Achaicus-te ang haw thei ziehun ka kipah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in keima’ lungsim le nomau-a’ zong ei thakhausah hi. Tuaci’n tua bang mite na theisiem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asia gama hlattuom pawlpite in ang noset uhi. Aquila le Prisca-te in zong ama’ inn sunga a kikhawm hlattuom pawlpi mite tawh Topa sungah lungsim tah tawh ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sanggamte zosie in zong ang noset uhi. A siengtho kinapna tawh khatlekhat na kinoset un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima Paul in ka khut mama tawh tami kihopina lai kang giel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa a it lo a koima po in samsiet thuoh taheh. I Topa ang pei hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Note tawh Topa Jesu’ ei hepina hing om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu Khris sungah note kang itna in note zosie tawh ang om den taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
